\par
\f0\u-10179?\u-9000?\f1  EPISODE 1 \f2\emdash\f1  What Children Need to Feel Safe\par
Scene 1 \f2\emdash\f1  Emotional Safety\par
Prompt:  \par
\ldblquote Soft illustrated SafeSteps style, child relaxing into parent\rquote s arms, warm muted colours, gentle lighting, soft home background, emotional tone: safe and connected.\rdblquote\par
\par
Scene 2 \f2\emdash\f1  Parent Presence\par
Prompt:  \par
\ldblquote Parent sitting beside child on couch, warm eye contact, soft smiles, soft pastel palette, gentle shadows.\rdblquote\par
\par
Scene 3 \f2\emdash\f1  Predictable Environment\par
Prompt:  \par
\ldblquote Simple illustrated home routine chart on wall, soft colours, calm environment, SafeSteps style.\rdblquote\par
\par
\f0\u-10179?\u-9000?\f1  EPISODE 2 \f2\emdash\f1  Warmth + Boundaries\par
Scene 1 \f2\emdash\f1  Warmth\par
Prompt:  \par
\ldblquote Parent giving gentle hug to child, warm tones, soft illustrated SafeSteps style, calm emotional tone.\rdblquote\par
\par
Scene 2 \f2\emdash\f1  Boundaries\par
Prompt:  \par
\ldblquote Parent calmly pointing to simple rule chart, child listening, soft pastel palette, warm lighting.\rdblquote\par
\par
Scene 3 \f2\emdash\f1  Balance\par
Prompt:  \par
\ldblquote Split screen: left side warmth (hug), right side boundaries (calm rule), soft illustrated style.\rdblquote\par
\par
