\par
Scene 3 \f2\emdash\f1  Calming Together\par
Prompt:  \par
\ldblquote Parent and child breathing together, hands on chest, soft illustrated style, calm emotional tone.\rdblquote\par
\par
\f0\u-10179?\u-9000?\f1  EPISODE 4 \f2\emdash\f1  Understanding Your Child\rquote s Needs\par
